repository-code: "https://github.com/salahealer9/new-jerusalem-geometry"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Euclidean geometry audit of John Michell's New Jerusalem
  diagram, including direct source-plate calibrations of Figures 12 and 14,
  a source-traceable construction grammar, the unit-only NJG_MICHELL forward
  composite, a preferred project reconstruction of the Figure 12 outer wall,
  a source-supported {7/2} Figure 14 topology, and frozen forward validation
  with no geometric refitting.
